        <rdfs:comment>A process where a synthesis or treatment has been performed, resulting in a synthesis report. We treat it as a characterization. Used by Activity instances and Activity Models to denote the type of measurements they refer to.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Synthesis or treatment Process</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://crc1625.mdi.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/SynthesisOrTreatmentReport -->


